# Committed on purpose: this repo deploys via Cloudflare Workers Builds
# (push = auto build), and PUBLIC_* vars must exist at BUILD time for the
# Astro ad components to render. Values are non-secret on/off switches —
# the real unit code lives in public/ads/*.html (same pattern as the
# committed wrangler.jsonc). See HANDOFF.md.
PUBLIC_ADSTERRA_SLOT_NATIVE_BANNER=gk2-native-1
PUBLIC_ADSTERRA_SLOT_INCONTENT_728X90=gk2-incontent-1
